	"description": [
		"In this course, students travel to Riga, Latvia. There they engage with the current and past issues of immigration, displacement and diaspora, and language politics in Latvia and the Baltic States more generally. The course centers community engagement: students divide into groups and collaborate with local community partners according to their interest in either community building, writing and media in exile, global LGBTQ+ support or environmental sustainability. Offered periodically during January term."
